  "query_preview": "..Through early next week...Dry conditions are \nexpected to continue through the weekend and into early next week. \nTemperatures will gradually warm each day, becoming 5-10 degrees \nabove average by Friday. Generally light winds are expected each day \nwith a gradual shift to west-southwest winds for Saturday and \nSunday. A couple of weak troughs will pass through the state through \nthe weekend. The first arrives on Thursday and the second Sunday \ninto Monday. The ensembles continue to show each trough lacking \nmoisture and remaining dry with minimal impacts expected across the \nregion. A better looking trough may arrive in the Tuesday-Thursday \ntime frame next week but models differ in timing and strength so \nstay tuned for updates over the coming days.",
